    "chunk_text": "\u00f0hymbrum to biscopum gehalgode. \u00d0\u00e6t se m\u00e6ssepreost Wigeard arcebiscop to gehadianne on Breotene to Rome w\u00e6s onsended, \u00d0\u00e6t Eastseaxan on \u00fea tid \u00f0\u00e6s mancwealmes to deofolgylde w\u00e6ron eft gecyrde, & eft \u00feurh \u00f0a Her enda\u00f0 se \u00feridde boc. Her onginne\u00f0 seo feor\u00f0e boc. \u00d0\u00e6tte for\u00f0ferdum Deusdedit \u00f0on arcebiscope, Wigheard w\u00e6s \u00feam biscophade to onfonne to Rome \u00d0\u00e6t \u00feeodorus se arcebiscop gondferend ealle Angelcynnes cyricean mid rihtgeleaffulre \u00d0\u00e6t Ceadda, be \u00feam \u00f0e we \u00e6r bufan spr\u00e6con, Myrcna m\u00e6g\u00f0e w\u00e6s biscop seald: & be his life, & \u00d0\u00e6t Coloman se biscop, forletenre Breotone, twa mynstro on Scottum geworhte, o\u00f0er \u00feam Be dea\u00f0e Oswies & Ecbyrhtes \u00feara cyninga: & be \u00feam sino\u00f0e \u00fee geworden w\u00e6s \u00e6t Heortfeorda, \u00d0\u00e6t adune asetton of \u00feam biscoprice Winfri\u00f0e, Seaxulf his biscoprice onfeng: & Erconwold \u00d0\u00e6t on Berccingum \u00feam mynstre mid heofonlice leohte getacnod w\u00e6s, hw\u00e6r gesette beon \u00de\u00e6t on \u00feam ylcan mynstre sum lytel sweltende cniht be naman genemde \u00f0a mynsterf\u00e6mnan, \u00f0e Hwylce heofonlicu tacnu \u00e6tywde w\u00e6ron, \u00fea \u00f0a seo modur sylf \u00f0\u00e6re gesomnunge of middanearde \u00d0\u00e6t Torhtgy\u00f0 seo Godes \u00feeowen \u00f0",
